     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "marks": [
       {
        "type": "bold"
       }
      ],
      "text": "Sarilumab (Kevzara) CYP substrates:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " Blockade of IL-6 signaling by IL-6Rα antagonists such as KEVZARA might reverse inhibitory effect of IL-6 & restore CYP activity → altered drug concentrations. On initiation or d/c of KEVZARA, perform therapeutic monitoring of effect (ex, warfarin) or drug concentration (ex, theophylline) & adjust dose prn. Exercise caution when co-administering KEVZARA w CYP3A4 substrate drugs where ↓effectiveness undesirable, ex, PO contraceptives · lovastatin · atorvastatin"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
